{"type":"node","id":"issue001","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-001 未知命令时 --json 无 stdout 输出","description":"未知命令报错未走 JSON 输出通道，违反 Agent 集成契约（所有命令含报错应在 stdout 输出单行 JSON）","content":"【复现】dtp frobnicate --packet ./x.dtp --json；2>/dev/null 后 stdout 为空，exit=2\n【期望】stdout: {\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"USAGE\",\"message\":\"未知命令 …\"}}\n【实际】stdout 空，仅 stderr 有人类可读行\n【影响】Agent 解析 stdout 拿到空串，契约破裂\n【修复方向】main.js 未知命令分支接入 JSON 错误输出","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"main.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.440Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.440Z","version":1,"hash":"8363b9703a1f0d576b7a44e44ad026907a921b07eb320fd94e5581e23501e228","tags":["P2","cli","json","contract"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue001","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"8363b9703a1f0d576b7a44e44ad026907a921b07eb320fd94e5581e23501e228","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.440Z","user":null,"version":1}
