{"type":"node","id":"issue003","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-003 AMBIGUOUS_ID 消息对完整 ID 误加省略号","description":"前缀歧义错误把完整 ID 也显示为 ab1… 形式，误导用户以为 ID 被截断","content":"【复现】add 两个节点 --id ab1/--id ab2 后 dtp get ab\n【实际】前缀 \"ab\" 匹配 2 个节点：ab1…, ab2…\n【期望】完整 ID 不带 …（截断显示才带）\n【修复方向】列表展示时判断是否完整 ID，完整则原样输出","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"resolve"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.663Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.663Z","version":1,"hash":"01bed3a42cd2fdecb3e2900c1ab2815f5da5bf9dfeb21dec9a92ef646eb1c5d6","tags":["P3","errmsg"],"status":"draft"}
