{"type":"node","id":"optim001","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-001 status/type 枚举校验一致性确认","description":"回归确认：--type/--status 均为大小写宽容+非法值报错（--type Document/--status APPROVED 均归一化），行为一致，无需修复","content":"【验证】T5/T6c/Y4/Y5 四组对照，枚举校验策略统一，撤销候选问题","extensions":{"severity":"P4"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.982Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:19.982Z","version":1,"hash":"5e81720c3799b10c1bdeef4b9a17ad8edc88ca745b1f6644f99c3325a4475874","tags":["P4","confirmed"],"status":"approved"}
