{"type":"node","id":"issue005","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-005 --version --json 输出人类文本","description":"dtp --version --json 输出 dtp v1.1.0 纯文本而非 JSON 对象","content":"【复现】dtp --version --json\n【期望】{\"ok\":true,\"version\":\"v1.1.0\"}\n【修复方向】version 分支识别 --json","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"main.js","fixed_in":"v1.2.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:38:24.913Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:47:20.612Z","version":3,"hash":"af91db8666b4bd328adfc254cc27cea1f6ca290b18be8f6090258e6f5e6ba78f","tags":["P4","cli","json"],"status":"approved"}
