{"type":"node","id":"fix003","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-003 写路径篡改巡检 warnings（ISSUE-004）","description":"","content":"【设计】不阻断写入（保持既定语义：仅 STRUCTURE 阻断），但加载时巡检当前状态节点哈希，发现不匹配 → 写命令 JSON 附 warnings 字段 + stderr 黄色提示\n【改动】packet.js 新增 hashMismatches()（与 verify 同源校验）；main.js ctx.load() 缓存 __hashWarnings 并 stderr 预警；_shared.js 新增 hashWarnFields()；add/update/rm/mv/checkout 五个写命令 out.ok 透传\n【边界确认】篡改历史版本行不可检出（append-only 重放模型只锚定最新状态，后行覆盖前行）；写入即洗白（哈希重算），警告仅在洗白前最后一次机会发出\n【验证】篡改当前状态行后 update JSON warnings+stderr 正确；干净包无 warnings 字段 stderr 干净；49/49 绿","extensions":{"files":"src/packet.js,src/main.js,src/commands/_shared.js,src/commands/add.js,src/commands/update.js,src/commands/rm.js,src/commands/mv.js,src/commands/checkout.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T16:46:54.650Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:47:20.993Z","version":2,"hash":"cc0fa67c91d681e01c9afd00de3579d2e0de3206ad69d8e0bbbbaee7239fd2b1","tags":["fix","integrity","write-path"],"status":"approved"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix003","field":"status","old_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","new_hash":"70ab47ec8fbd75027e36d5fae28639b51de6e7265220723cc99156dca295fcc5","timestamp":"2026-09-09T16:47:20.993Z","user":"dogfood-agent","version":2}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T16:47:20.993Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue006","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-006 --output 目录不存在时报 INTERNAL+原始 ENOENT","description":"export/pack --output 指向不存在目录时报 INTERNAL 并透出原始 ENOENT+Windows 绝对路径，Agent 会误判为工具缺陷而非路径错误","content":"【复现】dtp export n_root --format md --output no/dir/x.md --packet p.dtp --json\n【期望】清晰指明输出目录不存在及应采取的动作，exit 2\n【实际】{\"code\":\"INTERNAL\",\"message\":\"ENOENT: no such file or directory, open 'C:\\...\\no\\dir\\x.md'\"}，exit 1\n【影响】错误分类错误（INTERNAL vs 使用错误）；裸栈路径对 Agent 无行动指引；pack --output 同样中招\n【修复方向】写入前检查 dirname 是否存在，不存在 → USAGE「输出目录不存在：<dir>（请先创建）」","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/export.js,commands/pack.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.239Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.239Z","version":1,"hash":"092e65d1b7e1f0f061170e3178d42ece128c16dab62184a773d373dbe1b72be8","tags":["P2","export","pack","io"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue006","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"092e65d1b7e1f0f061170e3178d42ece128c16dab62184a773d373dbe1b72be8","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.239Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.239Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue007","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-007 verify 对不存在的包脱离 NO_PACKET 错误契约","description":"verify 对不存在的包文件返回 checks 形状且顶层 warnings 为空数组，扫描 warnings 的 Agent 会漏判包缺失","content":"【复现】dtp verify --packet nosuch.dtp --json\n【期望】{\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"NO_PACKET\",...}}，与其他读命令一致\n【实际】{ok:false,file,size:0,nodes:0,...,warnings:[],checks:[{name:\"JSONL 可解析\",ok:false,...}]}，warnings 为空\n【影响】Agent 契约破裂：按 warnings[] 判定的调用方完全漏检；size:0/nodes:0 形似\"空包\"\n【修复方向】run() 入口先查文件存在性，缺失即抛 NO_PACKET 标准错误","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/verify.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.374Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.374Z","version":1,"hash":"64c287ea3cc9af05320f450f3ae1804ec82e94ed48ca9f313d270dfebdfde0a0","tags":["P2","verify","json","contract"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue007","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"64c287ea3cc9af05320f450f3ae1804ec82e94ed48ca9f313d270dfebdfde0a0","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.374Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.374Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue008","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-008 query --path 对不可解析路径静默返回空集","description":"query --path 首段就不存在时返回 ok+0 命中，而 get-path 对同一路径报 NOT_FOUND；打错路径或 MSYS 转换损坏时 Agent 拿到空集毫无提示","content":"【复现】dtp query --path \"/不存在/X\" --packet p.dtp --json → {\"ok\":true,\"nodes\":[],\"count\":0,\"total\":0}\n【期望】与 get-path 一致报 {\"code\":\"NOT_FOUND\",\"message\":\"路径不存在：…\"}；路径存在时子树过滤行为不变\n【实际】静默空集，与 get-path 同路径两副面孔\n【影响】静默失败：前缀过滤语义下不可解析路径永远 0 命中，无信息量；Git Bash MSYS 路径损坏场景尤甚\n【修复方向】run() 中 pathPrefix 存在时先 findByPath 校验可解析，不可解析 → NOT_FOUND","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.511Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.511Z","version":1,"hash":"3dd2a846524e559cc8d120b95e7e8ebe985f2ff79ec1d7ca148d518718c2fba1","tags":["P2","query","path","json"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue008","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"3dd2a846524e559cc8d120b95e7e8ebe985f2ff79ec1d7ca148d518718c2fba1","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.511Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.511Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue009","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-009 标题/包名空白处理三处不一致","description":"add 拒绝纯空白但不 trim 前后空白；update 同样保留；init 对纯空白名直接通过——三种入口行为各异","content":"【复现】① add --title \"  Q  \" → 标题保留双空格，路径寻址必须带空格；② init \"  \" → name=\"  \" 通过（add 却拒绝纯空白标题）\n【期望】三个写入口统一：trim 后落盘，trim 后为空即拒绝\n【实际】validateTitle 只拒纯空白不 trim；init 不做空白校验\n【影响】含空白标题造成路径寻址/查询静默不匹配（keyword 能查到但 path 查不到），极难排查\n【修复方向】validateTitle 返回 title.trim()；init 名字过 validateTitle（仅写路径调用，重放不受影响，已核实）","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"model/node.js,commands/init.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.658Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.658Z","version":1,"hash":"f9542c0182d8afadbde91b9e47b93d3ac946ab36a14b07e6c4c861f1b6d741e4","tags":["P3","add","update","init","title"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue009","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"f9542c0182d8afadbde91b9e47b93d3ac946ab36a14b07e6c4c861f1b6d741e4","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.658Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.658Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue010","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-010 无位置参数命令的多余参数报错无 --packet 提示","description":"verify/pack/query 等无位置参数命令对 dtp verify 包文件.dtp 这类自然调用报「多余的参数」却不提示应使用 --packet","content":"【复现】dtp verify mypacket.dtp --json → {\"code\":\"USAGE\",\"message\":\"多余的参数 \"mypacket.dtd\"（查看 dtp verify --help）\"}\n【期望】对零位置参数命令追加提示：不接受位置参数，指定数据包请用 --packet\n【实际】仅指向 --help，多一步往返\n【影响】高频自然写法（把包路径当位置参数）得不到直接行动指引\n【修复方向】cli.js 多余参数分支按 argSpecs.length===0 定制消息","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"cli.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.791Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.791Z","version":1,"hash":"a1c9d5ab2b500e563763a9afe279287dec0d1f02915c0e11f6d975ead287965d","tags":["P3","cli","usage"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue010","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"a1c9d5ab2b500e563763a9afe279287dec0d1f02915c0e11f6d975ead287965d","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.791Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.791Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim002","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-002 query --limit 截断时人类输出不提示总数","description":"JSON 输出有 total 字段，但人类表格输出被 --limit 截断时只显示已返回条数，不知还有多少被截","content":"【现状】query --limit 2 命中 5 条 → 表格后仅「2 个节点」\n【建议】count < total 时表格后加暗色提示「共 N 个节点（--limit 截断）」","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/query.js,_shared.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.942Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.942Z","version":1,"hash":"7981e4dd215de3c704ce3f637a7eb260a83e63d02a071ecb7d0c85cbc374ecb8","tags":["P3","query","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim002","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"7981e4dd215de3c704ce3f637a7eb260a83e63d02a071ecb7d0c85cbc374ecb8","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.942Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.942Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim003","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-003 export md 正文标题层级与 init --version 校验（暂缓）","description":"两项低频争议项登记暂缓：export md 将节点正文原样内嵌，正文中的 # 一级标题会打破文档层级（内容保真 vs 层级调整两难）；init --version 接受任意字符串（not-a-version 也通过），但版本字段仅信息性不影响功能","content":"【export md】节点 content 以 \"# 标题\" 开头时直接内嵌会与节点标题层级冲突；可选方案：按 depth 提升 content 内标题级别，但会改写内容形态，需权衡\n【init --version】无格式校验；可加宽松校验（^v?\\d+ 开头）或保持自由文本，倾向后者+文档说明","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/export.js,commands/init.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:56.075Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:56.075Z","version":1,"hash":"4ea4816d07f2984b66c9b90296d110c328c6b096826243274e03e522eb8c8fac","tags":["P3","export","init"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim003","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"4ea4816d07f2984b66c9b90296d110c328c6b096826243274e03e522eb8c8fac","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:51:56.075Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
