{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.720Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue007","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-007 verify 对不存在的包脱离 NO_PACKET 错误契约","description":"verify 对不存在的包文件返回 checks 形状且顶层 warnings 为空数组，扫描 warnings 的 Agent 会漏判包缺失","content":"【复现】dtp verify --packet nosuch.dtp --json\n【期望】{\"ok\":false,\"error\":{\"code\":\"NO_PACKET\",...}}，与其他读命令一致\n【实际】{ok:false,file,size:0,nodes:0,...,warnings:[],checks:[{name:\"JSONL 可解析\",ok:false,...}]}，warnings 为空\n【影响】Agent 契约破裂：按 warnings[] 判定的调用方完全漏检；size:0/nodes:0 形似\"空包\"\n【修复方向】run() 入口先查文件存在性，缺失即抛 NO_PACKET 标准错误","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/verify.js","fixed_in":"v1.3.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.374Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.854Z","version":3,"hash":"b7543d580dee77879b0cb5f144563b6ee4fe3110afa7fbc9065fbe1e8c84d4fa","tags":["P2","verify","json","contract"],"status":"approved"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue007","field":"status","old_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","new_hash":"70ab47ec8fbd75027e36d5fae28639b51de6e7265220723cc99156dca295fcc5","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.854Z","user":"dogfooding","version":3}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue007","field":"extensions.fixed_in","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"5008b0251e7abd61f8545c4450f6c65981bb84060328222a3147027190749fbb","timestamp":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.854Z","user":"dogfooding","version":3}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.854Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue008","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-008 query --path 对不可解析路径静默返回空集","description":"query --path 首段就不存在时返回 ok+0 命中，而 get-path 对同一路径报 NOT_FOUND；打错路径或 MSYS 转换损坏时 Agent 拿到空集毫无提示","content":"【复现】dtp query --path \"/不存在/X\" --packet p.dtp --json → {\"ok\":true,\"nodes\":[],\"count\":0,\"total\":0}\n【期望】与 get-path 一致报 {\"code\":\"NOT_FOUND\",\"message\":\"路径不存在：…\"}；路径存在时子树过滤行为不变\n【实际】静默空集，与 get-path 同路径两副面孔\n【影响】静默失败：前缀过滤语义下不可解析路径永远 0 命中，无信息量；Git Bash MSYS 路径损坏场景尤甚\n【修复方向】run() 中 pathPrefix 存在时先 findByPath 校验可解析，不可解析 → NOT_FOUND","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/query.js","fixed_in":"v1.3.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-09T17:51:55.511Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T17:55:47.982Z","version":3,"hash":"e24901ffa66b1a090818eca1408f3a21cbcfdd60eaef4f98f29a84654766f6f6","tags":["P2","query","path","json"],"status":"approved"}
