{"type":"node","id":"issue014","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-014 history --limit 非严格整数被静默截断","description":"与 ISSUE-011 同源：--limit 用 Number.parseInt，1.5→1、2abc→2、1e2→1 被静默截断为版本数","content":"【复现】dtp history auth --limit 1.5 → 显示 1 个版本；--limit 2abc → 2 个；--limit 1e2 → 1 个\n【期望】非 ^\\d+$ 报 USAGE exit 2\n【实际】parseInt 隐式截断，静默接受\n【影响】调用方传带单位/小数时得到意外版本数，无任何提示\n【修复方向】history.js 改严格正整数校验（trim 后 /^\\d+$/ 且 >0），错误信息带原值","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/history.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.249Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.249Z","version":1,"hash":"860b3eb4bc805dfb0362156cdc66c27ac71663059cc733186c5795a6c718cf41","tags":["P3","history","limit"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue014","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"860b3eb4bc805dfb0362156cdc66c27ac71663059cc733186c5795a6c718cf41","timestamp":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.249Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.249Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue015","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-015 前缀歧义消息不列候选（resolveIdAny）","description":"resolveIdAny 对前缀歧义只报数量不列候选，history/checkout 无法据此消歧；resolveRef 却会列出前 5 个","content":"【复现】dtp history amb → 前缀 \"amb\" 匹配 2 个节点（无候选列表）\n【对照】dtp get amb（resolveRef）→ 前缀 \"amb\" 匹配 2 个节点：amb1, amb2\n【期望】两条解析路径的歧义消息一致，均列出候选\n【实际】resolveIdAny 缺失候选，多一步往返/无法消歧\n【修复方向】抽取候选格式化助手，resolveRef 与 resolveIdAny 共用","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"packet.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.288Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.288Z","version":1,"hash":"90ea3df9843329234d6f78ba4f63ef8eb9ed2a3dec41c7b765abb9573cc369ff","tags":["P3","history","checkout","errmsg"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue015","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"90ea3df9843329234d6f78ba4f63ef8eb9ed2a3dec41c7b765abb9573cc369ff","timestamp":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.288Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.288Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"issue016","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-016 pack 后 history 旧值误显 ∅ 且计数误导","description":"pack 压缩只保留最新版本快照，history 却把不可考的旧值显示为 ∅（形似旧值为空），且 total_versions=1 与 total_entries=8 并存易误读","content":"【复现】dtp pack 后再 dtp history auth：v7 显示 description: ∅ → 多行…（旧值其实是「初始」）；total_versions=1 而 total_entries=8\n【期望】快照已压缩时旧值不可考应回退哈希显示（不伪装成空），并显式告知快照已压缩\n【实际】∅ 误导 + 计数并列无说明\n【影响】历史可信度受损：用户以为旧值为空；Agent 误判变更\n【修复方向】makeValueResolver：前一快照缺失且 version>1 时返回 null 走哈希回退；JSON 增 compacted 字段，人类输出附压缩提示","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/history.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.324Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.324Z","version":1,"hash":"aff31a2ea5f63e2b5d8a5c37922589b015477849335d001eafae6882445c2b2d","tags":["P2","history","pack","integrity"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"issue016","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"aff31a2ea5f63e2b5d8a5c37922589b015477849335d001eafae6882445c2b2d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.324Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.324Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim008","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-008 history JSON fields 为预渲染字符串","description":"versions[].fields 是 '字段: 旧 → 新' 形式的字符串（含 ∅/转义换行），Agent 难以结构化消费","content":"【现状】fields:[\"content: v1 内容 → v2 内容\"]，无结构化 old/new\n【建议】附 changes:[{field,old,new}] 供程序消费，fields 保留人类可读；属契约扩展，暂缓","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"commands/history.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.360Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.360Z","version":1,"hash":"62cdf895661cad90c648c13bcba9ed89fc7db97f9e1656e61e30faf169390179","tags":["P3","history","json"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim008","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"62cdf895661cad90c648c13bcba9ed89fc7db97f9e1656e61e30faf169390179","timestamp":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.360Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.360Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim009","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-009 move 历史 parent_id 与 *moved 冗余","description":"mv 会在同版本同时记录 parent_id: root → auth（裸 ID）与 *moved path → path，前者晦涩冗余","content":"【现状】v2 显示两行：parent_id: root → auth；*moved /包/移动页 → /包/认证模块/移动页\n【建议】父变更以路径呈现或与 *moved 去重；影响小，暂缓","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"commands/history.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.398Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.398Z","version":1,"hash":"b7f41b14ecb5f80333231a561093d8103f1fdec72073c9495df8e95b953874cf","tags":["P4","history","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim009","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"b7f41b14ecb5f80333231a561093d8103f1fdec72073c9495df8e95b953874cf","timestamp":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.398Z","user":"dogfooding","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.398Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"fix008","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-008 history 参数与压缩历史修正（ISSUE-014/015/016）","description":"--limit 改严格正整数校验；前缀歧义统一列出候选；pack 后旧值回退哈希并标记 compacted","content":"【根因】① history.js 用 Number.parseInt 解析 --limit，1.5/2abc/1e2 被静默截断；② packet.resolveIdAny 歧义消息只报数量不列候选（resolveRef 却会列）；③ pack 压缩仅留最新版本快照，makeValueResolver 对缺失的前一快照读成 null，history 误显 ∅（实为不可考），且 total_versions 与 total_entries 并列无说明\n【改动】history.js：--limit 用 /^\\d+$/ 且 >0 严格校验，错误带原值；新增 earliest/compacted 判定，前一快照缺失且 version>1 时 resolveValues 返回 null 走哈希回退，JSON 增 compacted 字段，人类输出附「快照已压缩」提示；packet.js：抽取 formatCandidates，resolveRef 与 resolveIdAny 歧义消息统一列出候选，package.json bump v1.5.0\n【验证】新增 test/history-edges.test.js 3 组：limit 非整数（1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10/0/-1/abc）均 USAGE exit2 且合法值正常；history/get 歧义均列出 amb1,amb2；pack 后 compacted=true、旧值不含 ∅、人类输出含「快照已压缩」；63/63 测试全绿，无历史包回归","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.0","issues":"ISSUE-014,ISSUE-015,ISSUE-016"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:22.886Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:22.886Z","version":1,"hash":"8c8167be40a2001b11305ab36d1d974424138458f8987bcca7958307b86e70a4","tags":["P2","P3","history","validation","integrity"],"status":"draft"}
