{"type":"node","id":"issue016","parent_id":"f_issues","node_type":"requirement","title":"ISSUE-016 pack 后 history 旧值误显 ∅ 且计数误导","description":"pack 压缩只保留最新版本快照，history 却把不可考的旧值显示为 ∅（形似旧值为空），且 total_versions=1 与 total_entries=8 并存易误读","content":"【复现】dtp pack 后再 dtp history auth：v7 显示 description: ∅ → 多行…（旧值其实是「初始」）；total_versions=1 而 total_entries=8\n【期望】快照已压缩时旧值不可考应回退哈希显示（不伪装成空），并显式告知快照已压缩\n【实际】∅ 误导 + 计数并列无说明\n【影响】历史可信度受损：用户以为旧值为空；Agent 误判变更\n【修复方向】makeValueResolver：前一快照缺失且 version>1 时返回 null 走哈希回退；JSON 增 compacted 字段，人类输出附压缩提示","extensions":{"severity":"P2","area":"commands/history.js","fixed_in":"v1.5.0"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:22:50.324Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:23.209Z","version":4,"hash":"57adf9425aa8eaceeb57a32ccdb62f1452d6f3e9511cea06e2c5d0b77bfca2a6","tags":["P2","history","pack","integrity"],"status":"approved"}
