{"type":"node","id":"fix008","parent_id":"f_fixlog","node_type":"document","title":"FIX-008 history 参数与压缩历史修正（ISSUE-014/015/016）","description":"--limit 改严格正整数校验；前缀歧义统一列出候选；pack 后旧值回退哈希并标记 compacted","content":"【根因】① history.js 用 Number.parseInt 解析 --limit，1.5/2abc/1e2 被静默截断；② packet.resolveIdAny 歧义消息只报数量不列候选（resolveRef 却会列）；③ pack 压缩仅留最新版本快照，makeValueResolver 对缺失的前一快照读成 null，history 误显 ∅（实为不可考），且 total_versions 与 total_entries 并列无说明\n【改动】history.js：--limit 用 /^\\d+$/ 且 >0 严格校验，错误带原值；新增 earliest/compacted 判定，前一快照缺失且 version>1 时 resolveValues 返回 null 走哈希回退，JSON 增 compacted 字段，人类输出附「快照已压缩」提示；packet.js：抽取 formatCandidates，resolveRef 与 resolveIdAny 歧义消息统一列出候选，package.json bump v1.5.0\n【验证】新增 test/history-edges.test.js 3 组：limit 非整数（1.5/2abc/1e2/0x10/0/-1/abc）均 USAGE exit2 且合法值正常；history/get 歧义均列出 amb1,amb2；pack 后 compacted=true、旧值不含 ∅、人类输出含「快照已压缩」；63/63 测试全绿，无历史包回归","extensions":{"fixed_in":"v1.5.0","issues":"ISSUE-014,ISSUE-015,ISSUE-016"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T06:23:22.886Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T07:00:47.652Z","version":2,"hash":"7177c6a52abbd5b320fefef094f555eb9b607d25093868b84141f3575aabeb4d","tags":["P2","P3","history","validation","integrity"],"status":"review"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"fix008","field":"status","old_hash":"6ae048f08fcab44bfbc8463f074bfdb40f94c6bdf56d3aad9a7e1c05e5d5b5c1","new_hash":"fe82cb229e29dfc87a309c8d1679ff9f58be239c8e6f3ff52bc431efb3709b6b","timestamp":"2026-09-10T07:00:47.652Z","user":"agent","version":2}
