{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.760Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim016","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-016 get 人类输出扩展字段数组逐条分行展示","description":"acceptance 等数组值 JSON.stringify 挤一行，逐条对照验收困难","content":"【现状】printNodeDetail 扩展行 k=JSON.stringify(v) 单行拼接，acceptance 三条验收标准挤一行终端折行混乱\n【建议】数组值分行带编号展示（acceptance:\\n 1. 条目一\\n 2. 条目二），标量保持同行\n【取舍】采纳：仅改人类输出排版，--json 契约不动；验收对照是工作流核心场景，收益明确\n【验证】get 含数组 ext 的节点：逐条编号行出现；标量 ext 仍同行；--json 不变","extensions":{"severity":"P3","area":"src/commands/_shared.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.799Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.799Z","version":1,"hash":"278bf28cf2680254b462986e27a045dc211931e9506c5417fe2d0ea7496aa08c","tags":["P3","ext","ux"],"status":"draft"}
{"type":"changelog","node_id":"optim016","field":"*created","old_hash":null,"new_hash":"278bf28cf2680254b462986e27a045dc211931e9506c5417fe2d0ea7496aa08c","timestamp":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.799Z","user":"agent","version":1}
{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.799Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim017","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-017 query 人类输出扩展字段摘要（暂缓）","description":"批量复核验收标准时 query 表格不含 extensions，需逐个 get（暂缓）","content":"【现状】query/ls 人类表格仅 ID/TYPE/STATUS/VER/TITLE/PATH；批量看任务验收标准要 N 次 get（--json 含完整 extensions 可脚本化兜底）\n【建议】表格附加摘要列（如 acc×3 表示 3 条验收标准）或 --fields 选择列\n【取舍】（暂缓）列宽与摘要规则需设计，当前 --json 链路无损可兜底\n【验证】若推进：表格含 acceptance 条数摘要且不破坏窄屏","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/commands/_shared.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.836Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.836Z","version":1,"hash":"0ac45a037b06eefda1b8d30e4a2bb1432bd7e985a4a815e27160da6410af8b44","tags":["P4","query","ux"],"status":"draft"}
