{"type":"packet_meta","packet_id":"pkt-9b1ce357-a227-4edd-a696-38be61a796c4","name":"dtp 功能回归任务包","version":"v1.1.0-regression","created_at":"2026-09-09T16:33:08.900Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.874Z","root_node_id":"reg_root","metadata":{"purpose":"dogfooding回归"}}
{"type":"node","id":"optim019","parent_id":"f_optim","node_type":"knowledge","title":"OPTIM-019 --ext JSON 字面量静默类型转换无写侧提示（暂缓）","description":"note=1 存 number、note=true 存 boolean，写侧无类型提示，读侧异类型 0 命中（暂缓）","content":"【现状】--ext 值按 JSON.parse 尝试解析（help 已声明），note=1 → number 1；后续 query --ext note=\\\"1\\\" 字符串匹配 0 命中，写入者不易察觉类型差异\n【建议】add/update 人类输出变更字段时对扩展值附类型标注（如 note=1 (number)），或文档强化\n【取舍】（暂缓）JSON 字面量是文档化设计且 Agent 场景无害（类型精确），仅人类偶发踩坑\n【验证】若推进：写侧回显可见类型；--json 契约不变","extensions":{"severity":"P4","area":"src/model/node.js"},"created_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.912Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T11:28:30.912Z","version":1,"hash":"483e865aa684419b24a5b08a81cf55ef1b482b872e16271f0b83fcefd336cbed","tags":["P4","ext","ux"],"status":"draft"}
